# ── Personal study content ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Folders below contain private student notes, sources, and archived material.
# Content is ignored; folder skeletons are preserved via .gitkeep so the vault
# structure can be cloned and used immediately without exposing any student data.

# 01 - Inbox  (capture zone — student notes, student card)
01 - Inbox/*
!01 - Inbox/.gitkeep

# 02 - Sources  (primary learning materials uploaded by student)
02 - Sources/*
!02 - Sources/.gitkeep

# 03 - Subjects  (curriculum maps and topic trees)
03 - Subjects/*
!03 - Subjects/.gitkeep

# 04 - Concepts  (deep-dive concept notes)
04 - Concepts/*
!04 - Concepts/.gitkeep

# 05 - Practice  (quizzes, flashcards, drills)
05 - Practice/*
!05 - Practice/.gitkeep

# 06 - Plans  (revision schedules, exam prep)
06 - Plans/*
!06 - Plans/.gitkeep

# 07 - Outputs  (generated summaries, reports)
07 - Outputs/*
!07 - Outputs/.gitkeep

# 99 - Archive  (archived student content — all batches)
# samples/ is tracked to showcase vault note formats for new users
99 - Archive/*
!99 - Archive/.gitkeep
!99 - Archive/samples/
